{"time": 1770553957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "920259710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "（乱r）"}
{"time": 1770553966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678655112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1162084637"}, "sender": {"id": "1162084637", "name": "十二月星回"}, "message": "“那个，我先自我介绍一下，我叫云栖，是个侦探。”\r\n礼貌的伸出手"}
{"time": 1770553971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "917025964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1162084637"}, "sender": {"id": "1162084637", "name": "十二月星回"}, "message": "（你咋知道我在打字）"}
{"time": 1770553984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "306552472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "（我的PL们都在打字吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1770554027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "621584056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“我叫魏暮莲，是个，牧师。”\n握上对方伸出的手。"}
{"time": 1770554071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1750322392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“你也是受米罗警探邀请来的吧？”"}
{"time": 1770554128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521637287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1162084637"}, "sender": {"id": "1162084637", "name": "十二月星回"}, "message": "“对，我是受他委托来这里的，很高兴认识你，我们要不先办入住吧？”\r\n点了点头，回答道"}
{"time": 1770554143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1258910560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1162084637"}, "sender": {"id": "1162084637", "name": "十二月星回"}, "message": "（我结束了）"}
{"time": 1770554170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "47765556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“好，前台在那边吧？我们一起吧。”"}
{"time": 1770554314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "276427619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "“欢迎来到橡树旅馆，请问有什么可以帮您？”前台的女孩梳着简单的高马尾，眼下笑起来时有一条浅浅的卧蚕。她歪了歪头，状似无意地提起，“刚刚听见你们说的米罗警探……前几天我们旅馆去做例行报备的时候，好像没有见到过这位警探的名字……”"}
{"time": 1770554397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40188112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“我们要办理入住。嗯？没有听过米罗警探？这不对吧？”\n转头看向云栖。"}
{"time": 1770554475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "926406152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "（等待。）"}
{"time": 1770554482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794261450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "（我的pl们都在rp吗）"}
{"time": 1770554491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1390142567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1162084637"}, "sender": {"id": "1162084637", "name": "十二月星回"}, "message": "“给的委托函确实有警厅的标识啊。”\r\n皱着眉头思索。"}
{"time": 1770554504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2077909753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1162084637"}, "sender": {"id": "1162084637", "name": "十二月星回"}, "message": "（乱说话中）"}
{"time": 1770554510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463610146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1162084637"}, "sender": {"id": "1162084637", "name": "十二月星回"}, "message": "（其实我不知道有没有）"}
{"time": 1770554520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159251247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“嘶，我们先调查吧，万一是米罗警探还没到呢？”"}
{"time": 1770554632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1310846250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1162084637"}, "sender": {"id": "1162084637", "name": "十二月星回"}, "message": "“也是，反正给了钱的。我就当接单了。”\r\n耸耸肩表示认同"}
{"time": 1770554645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702417869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1162084637"}, "sender": {"id": "1162084637", "name": "十二月星回"}, "message": "“谢谢前台小姐的提醒”"}
{"time": 1770554652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1140363810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "“嗯……如果你们是为了查失踪案来的那太好了！我先帮你们登记入住，如果你们要调查的话可以先去图书馆问问看！”\n前台女孩写下了你们的个人信息，随后递来一把钥匙。“最近旅馆房源有点紧张，现在只剩一间房间了，委屈二位挤一挤了……”"}
{"time": 1770554761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87765276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“好的，谢谢。”"}
{"time": 1770554768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042835416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1162084637"}, "sender": {"id": "1162084637", "name": "十二月星回"}, "message": "“最近有很多人来这里吗？我看这里交通也不算便利的样子？”"}
{"time": 1770554791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1721238693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1162084637"}, "sender": {"id": "1162084637", "name": "十二月星回"}, "message": "（打探中）"}
{"time": 1770554821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "709755309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "准备往上走了，一听云栖的话语选择站边上一起听。"}
{"time": 1770554875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140587837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1162084637"}, "sender": {"id": "1162084637", "name": "十二月星回"}, "message": "（小牧师你调查业务不太熟练啊）"}
{"time": 1770554905, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961600472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "（我就一个坑蒙拐骗小神棍）"}
{"time": 1770554915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506936891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "“小镇最近似乎是在发展旅游，入住的人莫名变多了呢……听说我们这里快要通火车了，后面估计会更多人吧……”女孩还是微笑着的表情。但她似乎对镇上的事情所知不多的样子"}
