{"time": 1770555138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "157512174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "（对骰点没信心的话就rp，有信心就直接ra侦查或者图书馆）"}
{"time": 1770555174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459845190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“唔，看起来这一路好像没有什么异样啊，我以为因为人口失踪会有些不同嘞。”"}
