{"time": 1770556090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1981001125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1147708972]（我不行了）"}
{"time": 1770556120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743691318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“有教堂？这我熟啊！我们去看看不？”"}
{"time": 1770556142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "715036352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1162084637"}, "sender": {"id": "1162084637", "name": "十二月星回"}, "message": "“行啊，到你的专业了。小牧师带带。”"}
{"time": 1770556182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "158005329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“走走走！我最会坑，呃不是，在教堂工作了！”"}
{"time": 1770556208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1445121068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "（喂。）"}
{"time": 1770556222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "851699038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "走出图书馆不远，你们看到了一座黑色的、高耸入云的西式大教堂式的建筑正矗立在眼前。你们走近可以感受到这座教堂的巍峨——它足足有七八层楼高，尖塔式的顶直插云霄，黑色的高大建筑主体睥睨着接近的凡人。它不像一座教堂，更像一座地狱遗留在人间的遗物。可惜的是教堂大门紧闭并不开放，教堂的门口处坐着一个佝偻的老人，看着像是这座教堂的守门人。"}
{"time": 1770556235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123655047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "（过话术）"}
