{"time": 1770557932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1515785082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1162084637"}, "sender": {"id": "1162084637", "name": "十二月星回"}, "message": "“诶，莲莲这个日晷好像指的是东侧王宫那边。”"}
