{"time": 1770560472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "179398867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "盥洗室的一面墙上有一幅模糊不清的风景画。你走近仔细观察可以看见画上的树枝忽然晃动起来。\n墙角放置着一个宝蓝色的花瓶，花叶看起来格外健康。花叶的掩盖下有一滩蠕动的黑色污泥。"}
{"time": 1770560540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567142210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“咦！！！”"}
{"time": 1770560561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "736349071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1162084637"}, "sender": {"id": "1162084637", "name": "十二月星回"}, "message": "“这是不是那笔记本里的污泥。”"}
