{"time": 1770565401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1299800475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1770565448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073324744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "你们一路跟着洛夜来到了连廊。"}
{"time": 1770565458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "618587822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "廊柱的浮雕华美而繁复，像是什么深海的生物。触摸这些浮雕可以感觉到它们冰冷但湿滑，像是沾上了某种来自深海生物的黏液。你收回手的瞬间，浮雕上人物的表情从愉悦变成了痛苦。"}
{"time": 1770565481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "501548214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=17778AF7DBD0D1A9150238043B50FDAA.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQvgpGX9I1Y5ycp4bXzyHBdhhjSjhjh5AEg_woolpmMtJ7KkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ6-W0gjAFZVxesYnvSVapyHoC0smCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMKcc2ZdEl41BrfH1pCPKEBJwIvq_bf6Rn6eMrN6B8G_AFaFDKdQq6GJT0POpCneLfw,file_size=29281]"}
{"time": 1770565753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583919876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "洛夜细长而骨节分明的手抚摸上浮雕，那些浮雕在他手下莫名地乖顺。“这些浮雕都有很长的故事。如果你们想听，我可以慢慢讲给你们听。”他的神色被细碎的阳光分割，隐隐绰绰间看不真切。"}
{"time": 1770565762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "118032952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=46175083433121274274286FC40B04EF.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhThwe5USZ67smJLCFpNyfu9NkVZSBizPiD_CiiFuoC6n8qSAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhBBEVD-RO9SuHNNwcgvN1vNegL6roIBAmd6&amp;rkey=CAISMKcc2ZdEl41BrfH1pCPKEBJwIvq_bf6Rn6eMrN6B8G_AFaFDKdQq6GJT0POpCneLfw,file_size=7987]"}
