{"time": 1770566103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330955349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“诶？这是什么？”"}
{"time": 1770566122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320553598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“洛夜，这个你知道不？🥺”"}
{"time": 1770566490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "797603514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "“嗯。这个日晷上有一个刻痕，它可以打开日晷的机关。”洛夜伸手按下刻痕机关，日晷底座弹出了一个铅封的小匣子。洛夜打开小匣子，从里面捻起了一卷羊皮卷轴。"}
{"time": 1770566506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "117271204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "墨迹黑得像是来自深渊。上面的字离人类的文字相差甚远，只有极少数能够阅读：“……至约定之时，若王室未能诞下〇〇，则取其至亲〇〇……代为延续旧日契约……”"}
{"time": 1770566531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1513157670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“哇！！你好厉害！！！”"}
{"time": 1770566599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473078786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“嗯……这个有点难看的说实话”"}
{"time": 1770566628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1347968069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "“嗯，走了。这个羊皮纸不是你们现在能理解的东西。理解它的含义很可能会造成一些……不好的影响。”"}
{"time": 1770566640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1433472602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "你可以从花园的连廊前往国王的宫殿。这座王宫的整体造型近似于现实中一些知名的西方宫殿。"}
{"time": 1770566666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1076440914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“诶？不好的影响？好吧，那我不看了”"}
{"time": 1770566671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "598345821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1083423302", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "走到连廊尽头的大厅，左侧有一扇华丽的金色大门。"}
